WEBVTT

00:21.396 --> 00:23.064
Damn you!

00:24.190 --> 00:26.025
I'm really sorry.

00:28.945 --> 00:31.322
How many times do you have
to do this before you're satisfied?

00:31.406 --> 00:34.242
We're always telling you
to wash your hands with hot water.

00:34.325 --> 00:38.079
Don't be so hard on him.
Jiji is doing his best, too.

00:38.163 --> 00:40.040
Okarun, are you okay?

00:40.123 --> 00:42.041
Yes, somehow.

00:42.125 --> 00:43.960
Okarun, I'm so sorry!

00:44.043 --> 00:46.254
Please, don't worry about it at all.

00:46.337 --> 00:49.299
Evil Eye has gotten
a lot stronger than before.

00:50.717 --> 00:53.344
Hey, Grandma,
isn't this getting a bit out of hand?

00:53.428 --> 00:56.765
Jiji can't be careful
about everything, either!

00:57.766 --> 01:01.478
Yeah. We might not have
a house anymore by tomorrow.

01:01.561 --> 01:03.313
Don't wanna hear that "might"!

01:27.879 --> 01:32.258
Pardon the intrusion!

01:33.259 --> 01:35.220
If you're gonna intrude, go home.

01:35.303 --> 01:36.763
Okey-dokey.

01:38.932 --> 01:40.975
When are the hayashi folks coming?

01:41.059 --> 01:42.060
Who knows?

01:42.143 --> 01:44.521
Why don't we at least
settle on a formation?

01:44.604 --> 01:46.856
We're all over the place, especially Aira.

01:46.940 --> 01:50.443
Huh? I'm the leader!
You need to follow me!

01:50.527 --> 01:53.113
If we followed a dumbass,
we'd all go down!

01:53.196 --> 01:55.615
What was that? You pig head!

01:55.698 --> 01:57.700
- Ugly!
- Pig!

01:57.784 --> 01:59.410
Um, excuse me.

02:01.830 --> 02:05.542
Would this happen to be
Ms. Seiko Ayase's residence?

02:06.209 --> 02:07.669
So what if it is?

02:07.752 --> 02:09.129
Oh, so it is.

02:09.212 --> 02:10.380
Um, we are...

02:10.463 --> 02:12.006
...the ones who received your request.

02:13.591 --> 02:14.717
We are HAYASii.

02:19.264 --> 02:20.807
We are HAYASii!

03:59.906 --> 04:02.408
If that's the case, then just say so.

04:02.492 --> 04:06.204
We do have an image to maintain,
so we're sorry.

04:21.678 --> 04:22.720
Wicked.

04:22.804 --> 04:25.932
This is different from what I thought,
and it's getting me hyped up!

04:26.015 --> 04:28.101
- So awesome!
- You're kidding me.

04:28.184 --> 04:30.061
Are they spirit mediums?

04:30.144 --> 04:32.438
Nope. They can't even sense spirits.

04:32.522 --> 04:33.356
What?

04:33.439 --> 04:36.276
- But their performance is the real deal.
- Test, test. Mic check.

04:36.359 --> 04:39.612
They have the power to echo
their sounds into the spiritual world.

04:41.155 --> 04:43.616
Besides, if they can't sense spirits...

04:46.119 --> 04:49.831
they won't get dragged along
by evil spirits during an exorcism.

05:02.677 --> 05:04.345
Whoa, oh no!

05:25.241 --> 05:29.412
All right, you bastards!
Let's put some spirit into this!

05:30.872 --> 05:32.540
Yeah!

05:32.623 --> 05:35.168
I said, let's put some spirit into this!
Come on!

05:35.251 --> 05:36.294
Yeah!

05:36.377 --> 05:38.838
All right, bring it on! Let's go!

05:38.921 --> 05:40.298
Yeah!

05:40.381 --> 05:42.884
Are you all ready?!

05:42.967 --> 05:45.845
Yeah!

06:06.949 --> 06:10.161
Time for an exorcism!

06:18.586 --> 06:21.923
Time for an exorcism!

06:30.932 --> 06:36.604
Dark and corroded world in despair
Ravenous beasts are wandering

06:36.687 --> 06:41.818
Lying in wait for me like a hex
Blackest of destinations

06:53.162 --> 06:58.709
Echoing through the frostbitten sky
Song of the grimmest lullaby

06:58.793 --> 07:01.462
Pain that you suffered

07:01.546 --> 07:06.634
Plain from your scars
Hark, I can hear your requiem

07:06.717 --> 07:10.304
Starting to crumble down
In a cacophony of screams

07:10.388 --> 07:15.143
Spirit in lunacy
Coming apart at the seams

07:16.602 --> 07:20.690
Insatiate and wild
Roaming the land for a blood sacrifice

07:21.983 --> 07:26.362
Night after night
So go to sleep if you dare

07:30.283 --> 07:34.328
In the back! Are you watching?

07:36.247 --> 07:42.211
I won't leave anyone behind!

07:45.673 --> 07:48.217
Let's go!

07:52.513 --> 07:54.891
Bring it on!

07:54.974 --> 07:56.601
Stop it!

07:57.935 --> 08:03.232
Pallid the wasteland, filling the air
Howls of a fallen angel

08:03.316 --> 08:04.650
Momo! Hold Jiji down!

08:04.734 --> 08:06.903
Use your psychic powers.
Don't get near him!

08:06.986 --> 08:08.029
I know!

08:09.447 --> 08:15.036
Into oblivion
Feeling it call unto thee

08:15.119 --> 08:16.287
Don't erase him!

08:17.330 --> 08:19.207
Feral is your jealousy

08:19.290 --> 08:20.625
This is...

08:20.708 --> 08:22.835
Don't kill Evil Eye!

08:25.588 --> 08:30.426
Hey! Put some spirit into it!

08:30.510 --> 08:33.513
I promised I would play with him!

08:34.096 --> 08:37.099
He just wanted to play with someone!

08:37.183 --> 08:38.601
He was trapped all that time,

08:39.185 --> 08:42.146
but he kept dreaming of the day
that he'd get to play with someone.

08:42.230 --> 08:44.106
He even practiced dancing,

08:44.690 --> 08:49.695
but now that he's out,
he's just going to die again?

08:51.614 --> 08:54.033
That's way too sad!

08:54.617 --> 08:57.912
I'll try really hard
and not use cold water anymore!

08:58.663 --> 09:02.750
So please! Please don't kill Evil Eye!

09:04.252 --> 09:05.545
Fire aglow

09:05.628 --> 09:07.922
Scorching the earth
As it crosses the skies

09:08.005 --> 09:09.590
Please!

09:13.594 --> 09:15.221
I'm begging you!

09:46.919 --> 09:48.087
Um...

09:50.298 --> 09:51.966
Call it off.

09:52.049 --> 09:54.677
- Huh?
- No exorcism.

09:55.553 --> 09:57.847
I'll have Evil Eye join my family.

09:59.140 --> 10:01.058
Huh? What? What did you just say?

10:02.852 --> 10:06.981
Sorry to do this after coming
all the way here, but you can go home now.

10:08.149 --> 10:11.110
Oh, I see. I understand.

10:14.113 --> 10:15.781
You sure, Grandma?

10:15.865 --> 10:19.201
You heard Jiji.
Can't do anything about it.

10:19.285 --> 10:23.873
I personally like
that kind of spirit in Jiji.

10:24.999 --> 10:29.045
Then, what? We have to keep
taking care of this guy forever?

10:29.128 --> 10:31.047
I totally don't want to!

10:31.547 --> 10:36.093
I don't want my precious time
to be wasted because of his selfishness!

10:39.555 --> 10:43.351
Then, I'll learn how
to hold Evil Eye back.

10:44.935 --> 10:48.814
If I can become stronger
and easily hold Evil Eye back,

10:48.898 --> 10:51.942
there wouldn't be any problems
even if he were to transform, right?

10:52.026 --> 10:55.446
But is that something you need to go
out of your way to do, Takakura?

10:55.529 --> 10:57.907
You won't be able to sleep
peacefully anymore!

10:57.990 --> 10:59.867
Your life will be in danger.

11:01.869 --> 11:03.120
He's my friend.

11:08.459 --> 11:12.046
Then I'll become stronger, too.
It's easier if there's two of us, right?

11:12.129 --> 11:13.297
Hold on!

11:13.381 --> 11:17.009
I'll become stronger as well!
So that I can send you flying!

11:17.093 --> 11:19.011
I'd like to see you try, you ugly hag!

11:19.095 --> 11:22.473
Okarun, let me hug you.

11:25.518 --> 11:27.436
Okarun!

11:28.479 --> 11:29.397
You guys!

11:29.480 --> 11:31.399
- Okarun!
- Hot water!

11:40.449 --> 11:42.868
Sorry to have bothered you!

11:42.952 --> 11:49.083
If you need anything again,
please contact us!

11:49.166 --> 11:50.876
TOSHIRO

11:50.960 --> 11:53.212
Yeah. Great work.

11:56.632 --> 11:59.468
We might call you again real soon.

12:11.105 --> 12:13.899
Grandma, it's cold in the house now.

12:13.983 --> 12:17.653
For now, grab some cardboard boxes
from the supermarket.

12:20.573 --> 12:22.491
Sit on your legs, back straight.

12:23.284 --> 12:25.327
Clench up your lower abs.

12:25.411 --> 12:30.207
Imagine a laser beam coming out of the top
of your head and your fingertips.

12:34.837 --> 12:36.839
Don't fall over even when you get pushed.

12:36.922 --> 12:39.383
Sit like you're rooted to the ground.

12:39.467 --> 12:40.718
Sure.

12:40.801 --> 12:41.969
Jiji, like this.

12:43.012 --> 12:45.014
Back straight. Try pushing me.

12:45.890 --> 12:47.349
Try pushing really hard.

12:47.433 --> 12:48.976
Huh? Really?

12:51.645 --> 12:55.024
Whoa, you won't fall over!
Seriously? This is amazing!

12:55.107 --> 12:59.111
You were so reluctant to do this,
but you learned it after all.

12:59.195 --> 13:01.864
I didn't think
it would actually be useful.

13:05.743 --> 13:08.662
Back in grade school, you made
some weird poses. Was it this?

13:08.746 --> 13:11.874
I can use psychic powers
when I'm in this condition.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.627
This is the state
where chi is flowing out.

13:14.710 --> 13:18.339
When you enter this state,
you'll be able to use spiritual energy.

13:19.089 --> 13:21.300
Your spiritual energy is off the charts.

13:21.383 --> 13:23.302
With all that energy,

13:23.385 --> 13:29.225
maybe you'll be able
to hold Evil Eye back by yourself.

13:50.287 --> 13:51.997
It's cold.

14:11.308 --> 14:12.518
Hup.

14:29.493 --> 14:31.787
Whoa, you scared me.

14:31.871 --> 14:35.082
Mr. Jiji, please wash
your hands with hot water.

14:35.165 --> 14:36.667
Okay.

14:42.423 --> 14:44.508
It's getting warm now.

14:44.592 --> 14:45.718
Thanks.

15:10.117 --> 15:11.911
Thanks, Okarun.

15:11.994 --> 15:13.203
It's nothing.

15:17.124 --> 15:18.459
Oof.

15:28.177 --> 15:31.639
Oh my. The cardboard
is coming apart over there.

15:31.722 --> 15:35.601
Mr. Jiji, don't get close to it.
There's dew on it and stuff.

15:51.700 --> 15:54.453
I'm sorry all this happened because of me.

15:54.536 --> 15:58.082
Please don't apologize.
We're looking out for each other.

16:00.167 --> 16:05.714
When I was cursed by Turbo Granny,
I troubled the Ayase family as well.

16:06.882 --> 16:10.010
But they really devoted themselves
to taking care of me.

16:11.095 --> 16:15.849
I wanted to properly repay them
for living expenses and clothing costs,

16:15.933 --> 16:20.270
so I delivered newspapers and
took some money to them. But then...

16:22.982 --> 16:26.193
What good would it do to repay me?

16:32.449 --> 16:35.786
If you feel gratitude
for us taking care of you,

16:36.370 --> 16:41.125
you should pay it forward
to someone else who's in trouble.

16:43.502 --> 16:47.756
That's what it means
to look out for each other.

16:52.845 --> 16:54.304
Auntie is so awesome!

16:54.388 --> 16:57.683
I thought I wanted
to say things like that, too.

16:58.308 --> 17:01.770
In my case, I'm just acting tough.

17:02.521 --> 17:05.566
But I want to look cool,
even if it's just a little bit,

17:05.649 --> 17:07.026
so I'm mimicking her.

17:17.995 --> 17:21.165
There is absolutely no crisis management.

18:03.248 --> 18:05.375
Time to eat.

18:05.459 --> 18:07.169
Takakura, what about seconds?

18:07.252 --> 18:08.504
There's more miso soup, too!

18:08.587 --> 18:10.089
Make sure to eat lots.

18:10.172 --> 18:11.882
Oh, sure.

18:12.424 --> 18:16.428
Jiji, gotta clench your lower abs
and straighten your back.

18:16.512 --> 18:17.888
Emit chi at all times.

18:17.971 --> 18:18.972
Yes'm.

18:20.474 --> 18:21.850
More, please.

18:25.354 --> 18:26.772
Go get some yourself.

18:26.855 --> 18:29.775
Damn you, you did it for Okarun.

18:29.858 --> 18:30.859
Of course I did.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.986
What was that, ugly girl? You wanna go?

18:33.070 --> 18:36.740
- Pig!
- Ugly!

18:39.284 --> 18:41.120
Take care!

18:41.203 --> 18:43.372
- Takakura, did you forget anything?
- Hey! Take care!

18:43.455 --> 18:45.624
- Did you prepare for your classes today?
- Yes.

18:45.707 --> 18:49.002
- Huh? Take care.
- Man, my stomach hurts.

18:49.086 --> 18:51.588
I think I got too chilly
because the house was too cold.

18:51.672 --> 18:55.509
- You were sleeping with your stomach out.
- Then put the comforter on me!

18:55.592 --> 18:59.471
Takakura, let me tell you.
Momo Ayase thrashes around in her sleep!

18:59.555 --> 19:00.681
Hey, stop that!

19:00.764 --> 19:02.766
And she uses
other people's toner without asking.

19:02.850 --> 19:03.976
You said it was okay!

19:04.059 --> 19:09.273
- Aira grinds her teeth really loud!
- Hey, damn it! Don't be lying here!

19:15.070 --> 19:17.114
That's it! I'm gonna get a part-time job!

19:17.197 --> 19:18.282
What's gotten into you?

19:18.365 --> 19:19.616
I'm going to rebuild the house!

19:19.700 --> 19:20.576
Wicked!

19:20.659 --> 19:22.661
- What about your smartphone?
- Like I need something like that.

19:24.121 --> 19:26.957
Right now, we're seeking warmth.

19:27.040 --> 19:29.251
Was your house that cold?

19:29.334 --> 19:31.211
I mean, it's frigid, of course!

19:31.295 --> 19:34.423
Wasn't Ririna saying that
she was looking for some part-time help?

19:38.802 --> 19:41.138
Oh, she was. Was it for a restaurant?

19:41.221 --> 19:43.724
Seriously? Tell her I'll totally do it!

19:43.807 --> 19:46.435
But Momo, you never last long
in a part-time job.

19:46.518 --> 19:48.145
You always argue with the boss and stuff.

19:48.228 --> 19:50.397
I just hate the unreasonable.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.440
So cool.

19:51.523 --> 19:55.110
It's hard for a gal to recommend
someone who quits so quickly, though.

19:55.194 --> 19:58.322
It's fine! I have grown up!

19:58.405 --> 20:01.450
I won't give up oh so easily!

20:01.533 --> 20:03.702
Did you hear that, Ms. Muko?

20:03.785 --> 20:05.621
I did hear it, Ms. Mi.

20:09.166 --> 20:11.126
Okarun!

20:14.213 --> 20:17.799
Momo said she got a part-time job today,
so you can go home without her.

20:18.467 --> 20:20.636
All right. I understand.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.722
- And...
- ...so!

20:24.306 --> 20:26.183
You should go on a date with us!

20:26.266 --> 20:28.227
What? I decline!

20:28.310 --> 20:29.561
Come with us, you punk!

20:29.645 --> 20:31.438
Don't resist!

20:34.942 --> 20:36.693
Hold on, wait!

20:36.777 --> 20:38.528
I'm not gonna go on a date!

20:38.612 --> 20:40.364
We're just gonna have some tea!

20:40.447 --> 20:42.699
Don't you call that a date?

20:43.700 --> 20:46.411
Then if Momo and Jiji were having tea,
would that be a date?

20:46.495 --> 20:47.621
Of course not.

20:47.704 --> 20:51.083
Then tell us what's so different
when it's us, damn it!

20:52.251 --> 20:54.002
No way!

21:19.987 --> 21:21.071
KAMIGOE SHOPPING STREET

21:26.076 --> 21:28.495
I really don't want to!

21:29.204 --> 21:30.872
Okarun, this way! Over here!

21:30.956 --> 21:33.875
I'm not going to drink one drop of tea!

21:33.959 --> 21:35.252
You'll get thirsty.

21:35.335 --> 21:36.503
No, I won't!

21:36.586 --> 21:39.256
Absolutely sure?
You better not drink anything, then!

21:39.339 --> 21:41.049
I won't drink!

21:42.718 --> 21:45.178
Welcome home, master!

21:47.764 --> 21:48.682
Huh?

21:51.935 --> 21:53.437
How many in your party?

21:53.520 --> 21:55.188
Three!

21:58.650 --> 22:01.862
Hey, you maid over there!
Make sure to serve us well.

22:02.571 --> 22:04.239
Wait, Okarun?

22:04.323 --> 22:05.907
M-Miss Ayase!

22:14.416 --> 22:16.335
Come on now.

22:20.047 --> 22:22.966
Welcome home, master!

23:53.849 --> 23:56.810
There's not enough food!
Bring me some more!

23:56.893 --> 23:58.311
Everything's expensive, you idiot!

23:58.395 --> 24:00.689
A house with no food? I'll just run away!

24:00.772 --> 24:01.898
Fine, then, leave!

24:01.982 --> 24:04.776
Yeah? I'm never coming back
to this damn house, then!

24:04.860 --> 24:07.529
Next episode, "Feeling Kinda Gloomy."
